      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="how-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
        <h4>Pick Your Exam</h4>
        <p>Browse from Judiciary, CLAT, SSC CGL, and 20+ competitive exams. Choose a test series tailored to your target.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="how-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
        <h4>Take Mock Tests</h4>
        <p>Attempt full-length tests under real exam conditions — timed, auto-saved, with a live question palette.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-step">
        <div class="how-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
        <h4>Analyse & Improve</h4>
        <p>Review your rank, percentile, weak areas, and detailed solutions. Know exactly where to improve.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

