<!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">FAQ</span>
      <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>Everything you need to know about MockOrbit before you get started.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list" role="list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-1" itemprop="name">
          Is MockOrbit free to use?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-1" role="region" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
          <p itemprop="text">Yes! Creating an account and browsing all exam categories is completely free. We offer both free preview questions and paid full-length test series. Individual test series are available at affordable one-time prices with no subscription required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-2" itemprop="name">
          How is MockOrbit different from other mock test platforms?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-2" role="region" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
          <p itemprop="text">MockOrbit is purpose-built for focused exam preparation. Every question is curated by subject experts, not scraped or AI-generated. We provide live rank among all test takers, detailed weak-area analytics, and an Institute Portal for coaching centres to manage their students — features most platforms don't offer together.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-3" itemprop="name">
          Which exams does MockOrbit cover?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-3" role="region" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
          <p itemprop="text">MockOrbit currently covers Judiciary (PCS-J, HJS), CLAT, SSC CGL, SSC CHSL, Banking (IBPS PO/Clerk), UPSC prelims preparation, and more. We are continuously adding new exam categories. If your target exam is not listed, contact us and we'll prioritise it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-4" itemprop="name">
          How does the rank system work?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-4" role="region" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
          <p itemprop="text">After you submit a test, MockOrbit instantly calculates your rank compared to every student who has attempted that test. Your rank updates in real-time as more students submit. You also get your percentile score, which shows what percentage of students you scored higher than — a strong indicator of your exam readiness.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-5" itemprop="name">
          Can coaching centres use MockOrbit for their students?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-5" role="region" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
          <p itemprop="text">Absolutely. MockOrbit's Institute Portal is designed for coaching centres, schools, and colleges. You can register your institution, add students, assign specific tests to batches, set deadlines, and track every student's score, rank, and weak areas from a dedicated dashboard — all at no additional cost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item" role="listitem" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Question" itemprop="mainEntity">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-6" itemprop="name">
          How do I login? Is there a password?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-6" role="region" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" itemprop="acceptedAnswer">
          <p itemprop="text">MockOrbit uses OTP-based login for students — enter your mobile number, receive a 6-digit OTP via SMS, and you're in. No passwords to remember. Institutions log in with email and password registered during the sign-up process. Sessions remain active for 7 days on trusted devices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

